1
00:00:00,112 --> 00:00:01,938
Which brings us back to the copper box.

2
00:00:02,350 --> 00:00:05,025
Beneath the letters lay a hand-drawn schematic of

3
00:00:05,038 --> 00:00:05,938
the first floor.

4
00:00:06,350 --> 00:00:07,250
At first glance,

5
00:00:07,462 --> 00:00:09,362
it matched the modern survey perfectly.

6
00:00:09,788 --> 00:00:10,513
The grand hall,

7
00:00:10,788 --> 00:00:12,538
the conservatory, the library.

8
00:00:12,962 --> 00:00:13,950
But held up to the light,

9
00:00:14,250 --> 00:00:15,838
faint dotted lines appeared.

10
00:00:16,250 --> 00:00:17,975
The architect had built a second,

11
00:00:18,362 --> 00:00:20,575
hidden structure into the bones of the house.

12
00:00:20,988 --> 00:00:23,325
The library paneling the crew had spent weeks

13
00:00:23,338 --> 00:00:25,175
cleaning was designed to be hollow.

14
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:26,950
Behind it, a narrow,

15
00:00:27,138 --> 00:00:30,075
windowless corridor ran parallel to the main hallway,

16
00:00:30,475 --> 00:00:32,750
down to a sub-basement that exists on no

17
00:00:32,763 --> 00:00:33,650
