25
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:51,338
The echo under the butler's pantry floor.

26
00:00:51,750 --> 00:00:52,638
Every dinner party,

27
00:00:52,938 --> 00:00:54,200
every waltz in the ballroom,

28
00:00:54,562 --> 00:00:57,375
had happened just inches from hidden corridors and

29
00:00:57,388 --> 00:00:58,200
whispered ruin.

30
00:00:58,612 --> 00:00:59,288
The next day,

31
00:00:59,550 --> 00:01:01,463
the crew laid new oak boards over the

32
00:01:01,475 --> 00:01:03,175
